WEBVTT

00:01:41.860 --> 00:01:45.970
Max was attacked by Tyranno, a
Sacred Beast from the stone tablet.

00:01:45.970 --> 00:01:48.440
Genbu was put
in a bad situation.

00:01:48.440 --> 00:01:52.030
And the one to save Genbu
was Mariam, of all people.

00:01:52.900 --> 00:01:56.850
After keeping an eye on this
group's suspicious actions,

00:01:56.850 --> 00:02:00.030
Ozma's team steeled themselves
with a new sense of determination.

00:02:18.280 --> 00:02:20.420
Go, Shoot!

00:02:20.420 --> 00:02:22.540
Go, Dragoon!

00:02:27.710 --> 00:02:29.670
Go, Shoot!

00:02:49.010 --> 00:02:52.110
Rei, please show
me your Bey.

00:02:52.110 --> 00:02:54.250
What's wrong, Kyoujyu?

00:02:54.250 --> 00:02:56.610
I'm just curious
about something.

00:02:57.140 --> 00:03:00.620
I see that the Attack Ring
has taken a lot of damage.

00:03:00.860 --> 00:03:04.580
Yeah, it's been
bothering me for a while.

00:03:04.820 --> 00:03:09.730
Would you lend me
Driger for a little while?

00:03:09.730 --> 00:03:11.530
I'd like to repair it.

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:13.680
Thanks, Kyoujyu.

00:03:14.130 --> 00:03:15.300
Who's there?!

00:03:16.310 --> 00:03:17.680
It's you guys!

00:03:19.140 --> 00:03:23.220
What's the point of repairing a
Beyblade with no Sacred Beast in it?

00:03:23.220 --> 00:03:24.960
Mind your own business!

00:03:24.960 --> 00:03:27.780
What's the big deal, appearing
out of nowhere like that?

00:03:27.780 --> 00:03:29.780
Where's Rei's Byakko?

00:03:30.640 --> 00:03:35.650
Maybe you should worry about
your own Sacred Beasts instead?

00:03:35.650 --> 00:03:36.820
What?!

00:03:36.820 --> 00:03:41.440
If you want Byakko back that
badly, you'll have to battle us!

00:03:41.440 --> 00:03:46.530
They plan on getting Byakko back but they'll
just lose all their Sacred Beasts instead.

00:03:47.220 --> 00:03:48.570
You said it!

00:03:50.320 --> 00:03:52.040
What's your game?!

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:56.030
Takao, we came to
challenge you to a battle.

00:03:56.030 --> 00:03:57.030
--What?!

00:03:57.030 --> 00:03:59.240
A battle?

00:03:59.240 --> 00:04:01.530
Now you're
speaking my language!

00:04:01.530 --> 00:04:06.240
Obviously, we're aiming for the
remaining three Sacred Beasts.

00:04:06.240 --> 00:04:08.750
Takao Kinomiya's Seiryu.

00:04:08.750 --> 00:04:10.730
Kai Hiwatari's Suzaku.

00:04:10.730 --> 00:04:13.220
Max Mizuhara's Genbu.

00:04:13.390 --> 00:04:16.180
We're going to take all
three of your Sacred Beasts.

00:04:16.180 --> 00:04:19.330
Big talk, but we're gonna
send you packing!

00:04:19.600 --> 00:04:22.900
Our battle will begin
tomorrow at sunrise!

00:04:22.900 --> 00:04:26.730
At the abandoned amusement
park by the harbor!

00:04:26.730 --> 00:04:29.140
Yeah! We'll be there!

00:04:29.140 --> 00:04:34.140
In the name of the Saint Shields,
we will seal the four Sacred Beasts.

00:04:34.140 --> 00:04:36.020
So say your prayers!

00:04:45.250 --> 00:04:46.470
Feels like...

00:04:46.810 --> 00:04:49.570
This is the moment
we've been waiting for.

00:04:50.020 --> 00:04:55.560
Yeah. We know they're serious
about sealing the four Sacred Beasts.

00:04:55.560 --> 00:05:01.480
And that means tomorrow is our best
chance to beat them for good.

00:05:03.280 --> 00:05:06.410
There's something else
we have to do, too.

00:05:07.480 --> 00:05:10.700
Rei. We will get
Byakko back.

00:05:10.960 --> 00:05:12.080
Kai...

00:05:12.420 --> 00:05:14.740
It's not just about winning.

00:05:14.740 --> 00:05:21.590
Let's show them how the BBA team
battles until they just can't stand it anymore.

00:05:21.810 --> 00:05:24.780
We're not going to lose.
We'll beat them.

00:05:24.780 --> 00:05:27.390
That's a promise.

00:05:31.570 --> 00:05:34.720
Go, Sharcrash!

00:05:36.930 --> 00:05:37.970
Go, get them!

00:05:37.970 --> 00:05:39.710
Don't you lose to them!

00:05:44.640 --> 00:05:50.120
The mission we've been given is
to seal the four Sacred Beasts.

00:05:50.310 --> 00:05:55.120
To return their awesome power to the
stone tablet before it's used for evil.

00:05:55.690 --> 00:05:58.150
We will seal them in
this stone tablet,

00:05:58.150 --> 00:06:02.800
and charge full speed ahead into the
battle our ancestors started long ago.

00:06:04.660 --> 00:06:06.400
Okay, it's time to go!

00:07:03.170 --> 00:07:04.820
Welcome!

00:07:04.820 --> 00:07:09.110
And here I thought you guys
woulda turned tail and ran!

00:07:09.970 --> 00:07:11.030
What?!

00:07:11.340 --> 00:07:13.200
Take a gander at that!

00:07:15.980 --> 00:07:19.510
Byakko's sitting pretty inside
that tablet and he ain't happy.

00:07:20.100 --> 00:07:21.490
What?!

00:07:24.270 --> 00:07:28.420
He's right. I can see Byakko's
energy waves from the tablet!

00:07:28.420 --> 00:07:29.410
Darn...

00:07:29.410 --> 00:07:30.300
Byakko...

00:07:30.300 --> 00:07:35.440
Don't worry! The other three are
gonna get stuffed in there with him!

00:07:35.440 --> 00:07:39.010
Cut the trash talk and let's
get this battle started!

00:07:39.010 --> 00:07:41.000
C'mon, big-shot Ozma!

00:07:41.690 --> 00:07:42.620
Fine.

00:07:42.620 --> 00:07:45.700
All right! I'm up first!

00:07:45.700 --> 00:07:47.890
Don't get ahead of yourself.

00:07:48.090 --> 00:07:49.300
What?!

00:07:49.600 --> 00:07:51.460
I'm going first.

00:07:51.460 --> 00:07:52.770
Got it?

00:07:52.770 --> 00:07:54.880
I don't care who's up first!

00:07:54.880 --> 00:07:56.460
Just get on with it!

00:07:56.460 --> 00:07:59.300
I'm not going to
be fighting you.

00:07:59.450 --> 00:08:01.700
It's you, Max!

00:08:01.700 --> 00:08:03.610
Be my guest.

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:07.390
I accept. Mariam, let's battle!

00:08:17.730 --> 00:08:21.670
I'm going to seal your
Genbu, no matter what.

00:08:21.670 --> 00:08:24.260
That's my mission, after all.

00:08:24.260 --> 00:08:26.900
Mariam, I will defeat you.

00:08:26.900 --> 00:08:31.010
And I'll get Byakko
back for my friend!

00:08:35.900 --> 00:08:37.140
--Three!

00:08:37.140 --> 00:08:38.140
--Two!

00:08:38.140 --> 00:08:39.300
--One!

00:08:39.300 --> 00:08:41.690
Go, Shoot!

00:08:51.380 --> 00:08:52.180
Yes!

00:08:52.180 --> 00:08:53.360
Keep it up, Max!

00:08:53.360 --> 00:08:55.960
I'm just getting started!

00:08:55.960 --> 00:08:57.730
Sharcrash!

00:09:10.390 --> 00:09:11.800
Genbu!

00:09:18.530 --> 00:09:20.770
Dammit, what are you doing?!

00:09:20.770 --> 00:09:22.110
Sis!

00:09:26.790 --> 00:09:28.850
He's tough.

00:09:28.850 --> 00:09:32.040
But until I seal Genbu...

00:09:32.040 --> 00:09:35.280
Defeat is not an option!

00:09:36.310 --> 00:09:38.610
Sharcrash, do it now!

00:09:54.480 --> 00:09:56.400
Get out of there, Genbu!

00:09:56.400 --> 00:10:02.080
Not gonna happen. I'll follow Genbu to the
depths of hell if that's what it takes to seal him.

00:10:05.870 --> 00:10:07.530
Draciel's losing power!

00:10:07.530 --> 00:10:10.520
It can't stand up to
much more than this!

00:10:15.020 --> 00:10:17.060
Hang in there, Max!

00:10:17.060 --> 00:10:21.600
He's fine! Max isn't just
letting himself get hit.

00:10:22.090 --> 00:10:24.560
You don't know
when to quit.

00:10:24.560 --> 00:10:26.960
Just give me Genbu already!

00:10:30.200 --> 00:10:32.310
Finish him off!

00:10:34.530 --> 00:10:36.800
Genbu, dodge!

00:10:36.800 --> 00:10:37.820
What?!

00:10:47.120 --> 00:10:49.310
Sharcrash!

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:57.000
Go, Genbu!!

00:11:15.710 --> 00:11:17.820
Sharcrash!

00:11:19.540 --> 00:11:23.820
He calmly judged her moves and attacked in the closest opening.

00:11:23.820 --> 00:11:25.660
It's a very Max-like strategy!

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:27.380
Max-like?

00:11:27.380 --> 00:11:31.140
He was calculating his next move
while getting hit by Sharcrash.

00:11:31.140 --> 00:11:32.930
What does that mean?

00:11:32.930 --> 00:11:37.540
Max enticed Sharcrash by making it look like he was getting beat,

00:11:37.540 --> 00:11:40.200
and kept his cool as
he sized up her moves.

00:11:42.110 --> 00:11:45.010
Max thought that far ahead?

00:11:45.010 --> 00:11:48.880
Genbu believed in Max's
strategy and hung in there!

00:11:48.880 --> 00:11:50.120
Exactly!

00:11:50.120 --> 00:11:52.030
This is how I...

00:11:52.030 --> 00:11:55.380
How Max Mizuhara
battles as a Blader!

00:11:55.380 --> 00:12:01.650
This is how I can battle because
Genbu trusts me as a Blader!

00:12:02.080 --> 00:12:05.060
Battling because he can
trust him as a Blader...

00:12:05.060 --> 00:12:08.420
Because Genbu believes in him...

00:12:10.480 --> 00:12:15.320
I've been thinking about it. We
can have a good battle together.

00:12:15.690 --> 00:12:17.850
Between us as Bladers.

00:12:17.850 --> 00:12:20.320
Mariam!
Get your head in the game!

00:12:25.520 --> 00:12:27.220
Sharcrash is losing power!

00:12:27.220 --> 00:12:28.830
It's about to stop spinning!

00:12:30.210 --> 00:12:31.720
Sharcrash...!

00:12:38.590 --> 00:12:40.730
It stopped!

00:12:42.850 --> 00:12:45.010
Sharcrash!

00:12:56.600 --> 00:12:57.900
It's a draw.

00:13:01.440 --> 00:13:02.920
Draciel...

00:13:03.330 --> 00:13:05.500
Draciel!

00:13:06.220 --> 00:13:10.450
Draciel! Why?
Why did you stop?

00:13:10.450 --> 00:13:12.780
I had the upper hand!

00:13:12.780 --> 00:13:18.210
Sharcrash may have used up its last bit of
strength in response to Mariam's emotions.

00:13:22.340 --> 00:13:24.180
Sharcrash...

00:13:24.600 --> 00:13:26.300
Don't scare us like that.

00:13:26.300 --> 00:13:28.560
And I thought you
were about to lose...

00:13:28.560 --> 00:13:30.450
One more round, Ozma!

00:13:30.450 --> 00:13:31.630
Yeah.

00:13:31.630 --> 00:13:34.480
What's wrong?
That's not like you, Sis.

00:13:34.480 --> 00:13:38.670
Mariam, I hope you haven't
forgotten what our mission is.

00:13:38.670 --> 00:13:42.100
I know. You don't
have to tell me.

00:13:42.100 --> 00:13:44.830
Okay. Yusuf, Dunga.

00:13:44.830 --> 00:13:47.960
When I give the signal,
back up Mariam.

00:13:49.230 --> 00:13:50.320
Got it.

00:13:50.320 --> 00:13:53.230
I had my doubts about
leaving this to Mariam.

00:13:53.230 --> 00:13:56.250
Mariam, keep that in
mind as you fight.

00:13:56.250 --> 00:13:57.520
Do you hear me?

00:14:06.480 --> 00:14:07.610
Max.

00:14:07.610 --> 00:14:08.960
Takao...

00:14:08.960 --> 00:14:12.730
Draciel didn't
lose to Sharcrash.

00:14:12.730 --> 00:14:15.060
Just give 'em
everything you've got.

00:14:15.060 --> 00:14:18.020
Battle without any regrets.

00:14:18.020 --> 00:14:20.080
That's more important
than winning.

00:14:20.080 --> 00:14:21.690
Right, Max?

00:14:23.950 --> 00:14:27.010
Genbu, let's battle again.

00:14:27.010 --> 00:14:29.690
Fight alongside
me 'till the end.

00:14:29.690 --> 00:14:31.890
Yeah! That's the spirit, Max!

00:14:31.890 --> 00:14:34.740
We'll be rooting for you!

00:14:34.740 --> 00:14:37.440
Max, fight without any regrets!

00:14:37.440 --> 00:14:39.010
You can do it, Max.

00:14:40.420 --> 00:14:41.730
Genbu...

00:14:42.250 --> 00:14:43.900
Let's go!

00:14:45.400 --> 00:14:46.780
Here we go, Mariam!

00:14:46.780 --> 00:14:48.580
Bring it on, Max!

00:14:48.580 --> 00:14:51.380
--Three! Two! One!

00:14:51.380 --> 00:14:54.100
Go, Shoot!

00:15:19.380 --> 00:15:20.500
Wow!

00:15:20.500 --> 00:15:23.000
Kyoujyu, who's winning?

00:15:23.000 --> 00:15:24.770
They're even.

00:15:27.560 --> 00:15:30.760
Mariam!
Summon Sharcrash!

00:15:30.760 --> 00:15:32.710
Sharcrash!

00:15:45.610 --> 00:15:54.650
Sharcrash...

00:15:57.620 --> 00:16:00.110
This is bad!
Sharcrash has the upper hand!

00:16:00.110 --> 00:16:02.900
Draciel has lost
50% of its power!

00:16:03.610 --> 00:16:05.820
Rise, Genbu!

00:16:12.540 --> 00:16:15.930
I won't give you Genbu,
no matter what!

00:16:15.930 --> 00:16:18.920
You're not taking
my Genbu from me!

00:16:21.360 --> 00:16:23.020
Sharcrash...

00:16:23.820 --> 00:16:27.780
Oh... If Sharcrash
was taken from me...

00:16:27.780 --> 00:16:29.610
How would I feel?

00:16:30.190 --> 00:16:31.520
I...

00:16:31.520 --> 00:16:36.140
I never thought about
how I'd feel if I lost him...

00:16:37.250 --> 00:16:38.820
Sharcrash...

00:16:41.250 --> 00:16:46.400
I've been thinking about it.
We can have a good battle together.

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:49.010
Between us as Bladers.

00:16:49.010 --> 00:16:51.510
And here I thought you
were on to something.

00:16:52.560 --> 00:16:54.500
You don't get it either.

00:16:55.660 --> 00:17:00.380
Like I said, our mission is to
seal the four Sacred Beasts.

00:17:00.380 --> 00:17:04.350
But doesn't that mean
you're just like the others?

00:17:04.350 --> 00:17:06.720
What does your Sacred
Beast mean to you?

00:17:06.720 --> 00:17:10.000
Is it just a tool to seal
our four Sacred Beasts?

00:17:11.010 --> 00:17:12.680
That can't be it.

00:17:13.040 --> 00:17:16.840
Sacred Beasts aren't just tools.
You believe that too, Mariam.

00:17:16.840 --> 00:17:20.880
That's it! But I'm a
part of the Saint Shields!

00:17:20.880 --> 00:17:25.000
And the Saint Shields' mission is
to seal the four Sacred Beasts!

00:17:25.690 --> 00:17:27.010
Mariam...

00:17:28.050 --> 00:17:29.170
Max...

00:17:29.170 --> 00:17:30.800
I want you to understand!

00:17:30.800 --> 00:17:34.170
Genbu isn't just one of
the four Sacred Beasts!

00:17:34.170 --> 00:17:38.140
We're two hearts beating as one--
He's a part of me!

00:17:38.140 --> 00:17:40.910
I know... I know that!

00:17:40.910 --> 00:17:44.340
But I have a mission that
I just can't abandon!

00:17:44.340 --> 00:17:45.700
Mariam!

00:17:46.390 --> 00:17:47.730
Max...

00:17:51.210 --> 00:17:54.000
Go, Genbu!!

00:17:54.000 --> 00:17:56.210
Sharcrash!!

00:18:05.230 --> 00:18:07.070
Yusuf! Dunga!

00:18:07.070 --> 00:18:08.400
--Yeah!

00:18:08.400 --> 00:18:09.460
Stop!

00:18:10.850 --> 00:18:12.600
What's the meaning
of this, Mariam?

00:18:12.600 --> 00:18:16.610
This is a real battle between
Max and I! As Bladers!

00:18:16.790 --> 00:18:20.280
I won't allow you to interrupt
us with your dirty tricks!

00:18:20.570 --> 00:18:26.200
And I won't let you make a fool
out of the friend I fight alongside!

00:18:26.540 --> 00:18:28.210
Sharcrash...

00:18:28.540 --> 00:18:30.930
You aren't a tool!

00:18:30.930 --> 00:18:33.420
You're my friend
and we fight together!

00:18:33.750 --> 00:18:37.700
Max! I'll show you
how I fight as a Blader!

00:18:38.020 --> 00:18:40.320
Sharcrash!!

00:18:52.320 --> 00:18:53.530
Genbu...!

00:18:53.840 --> 00:18:56.100
Hang in there, Genbu!

00:18:58.400 --> 00:19:00.820
I won't lose... I won't lose...

00:19:00.820 --> 00:19:02.280
I won't lose!

00:19:02.280 --> 00:19:07.800
I can't lose until I get
Rei's Byakko back!

00:19:07.900 --> 00:19:09.620
Rei's Byakko...

00:19:13.600 --> 00:19:15.250
Oh, crap!

00:19:15.250 --> 00:19:17.270
I'm not just fighting for me!

00:19:17.270 --> 00:19:20.410
Bladers and their Sacred Beasts...
Bladers and Bladers!

00:19:20.410 --> 00:19:23.370
We combine our power
and fight together!

00:19:24.320 --> 00:19:27.410
I'll get Byakko
back for Rei!

00:19:33.730 --> 00:19:35.920
Genbu!!

00:19:59.120 --> 00:20:00.480
Sharcrash...

00:20:00.480 --> 00:20:01.760
Lost...!

00:20:01.760 --> 00:20:03.470
No way...

00:20:08.000 --> 00:20:09.250
Mariam.

00:20:11.360 --> 00:20:13.660
I lost, no doubt about it.

00:20:21.490 --> 00:20:24.850
But it's the first time
I've fought so seriously

00:20:24.850 --> 00:20:26.800
in my entire life.

00:20:27.090 --> 00:20:29.430
I want to fight
alongside Sharcrash.

00:20:29.430 --> 00:20:31.740
I want to fight
together and win.

00:20:31.740 --> 00:20:34.620
That was the only thing on
my mind in that battle.

00:20:34.620 --> 00:20:37.090
But for the first time,
we fought as one.

00:20:37.090 --> 00:20:38.830
I'm the same way.

00:20:38.830 --> 00:20:41.360
No, you were different.

00:20:43.040 --> 00:20:45.390
You weren't just
fighting for yourself.

00:20:45.390 --> 00:20:47.720
But for your friends, too.

00:20:48.750 --> 00:20:51.570
You fought me while you were

00:20:51.570 --> 00:20:55.520
thinking about all
of them down there.

00:20:56.450 --> 00:20:59.050
That's why I lost.

00:20:59.520 --> 00:21:01.250
But it was fun!

00:21:01.670 --> 00:21:06.320
It's been ages since I've been able to purely enjoy a battle like that.

00:21:07.040 --> 00:21:08.510
Mariam...

00:21:09.250 --> 00:21:12.490
I want to battle
again sometime.

00:21:13.010 --> 00:21:14.100
Yeah.

00:21:14.820 --> 00:21:18.240
For sure.

00:23:01.010 --> 00:23:04.550
Kai's up to bat to
get revenge for Rei!

00:23:04.550 --> 00:23:08.240
He's put in a pinch against the
Saint Shields' combined attacks!

00:23:08.240 --> 00:23:11.180
And then, a miracle!

00:23:11.180 --> 00:23:13.520
He's awakened, Chairman!

00:23:13.520 --> 00:23:15.390
"Then, good morning"?

00:23:15.390 --> 00:23:18.830
It's not like he was asleep!
Oh, forget it!

00:23:18.830 --> 00:23:21.400
Be sure to watch
the next episode, too!
